* DLOAD and DRESET are DIGITAL XSPICE ports, not analog voltages.
* Drive from d_source or another digital code model. Exact same DWA/reset logic.
* Ideal CT quantizer frontend and functional event-driven 5-bit controller.
* VSS must be simulator ground; bridges use fixed 0/3.3 V levels, not VDD tracking.
* No comparator transistor offset/noise/metastability or physical digital timing/power.
